OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FManchester City chief executive Ferran
OL,8,FSoriano has told his fellow European
OL,9,Fclub bosses the already lengthy legal
OL,10,Fbattle with the Premier League will
OL,11,Ftake "a lot more time" to conclude.
OL,13,FNews broke on Friday that City had
OL,14,Fbeen found guilty of all but one of
OL,15,F115 charges they faced of breaching
OL,16,Fthe league's financial rules,
OL,17,Fimmediately sparking speculation they
OL,18,Fcould face unprecedented sanctions.
OL,26,@sD@FOUsD@VO]
