PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FCity chairman Khaldoon Al Mubarak told
OL,8,Fsupporters in an open letter published
OL,9,Fon Saturday that the club were
OL,10,F"confident" of proving their
OL,11,Finnocence, and chief executive Soriano
OL,12,Faddressed the elephant in the room
OL,13,Fwhen he met fellow members of the
OL,14,FEuropean Football Clubs board in
OL,15,FCopenhagen on Monday.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
