CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FThe Press Association understands
OL,8,FSoriano said at the end of the EFC
OL,9,Fboard meeting that he felt he had to
OL,10,Fsay something given Friday's news,
OL,11,Fthat City disagreed with the ruling
OL,12,Fbut remained confident of winning and
OL,13,Fthat the club were still fighting.
OL,15,FSources in the meeting said Soriano
OL,16,Fthen remarked: "It's taken eight years
OL,17,Fto get here, and it's going to take a
OL,18,Flot more time."
OL,26,@xD@POUzD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
