CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FThe "eight years" Soriano referred to
OL,8,Fwas the opening of the league's
OL,9,Finvestigation into City in 2018.
OL,11,FSoriano, who declined to answer media
OL,12,Fquestions as he exited the meeting,
OL,13,Fmade the comments in the presence of
OL,14,Fsome other English top-flight bosses,
OL,15,Fwith Manchester United's chief of
OL,16,Finternational football relations Jean-
OL,17,FClaude Blanc and Everton owner Dan
OL,18,FFriedkin ` there in his capacity as
OL,19,Fowner of Roma ` also attending the
OL,20,Fmeeting in the Danish capital.
OL,26,@oD@EOUoD@QO]
