OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FAmong the alleged breaches, all
OL,8,Fstrenuously denied by City, was a
OL,9,Fcharge of failing to provide full
OL,10,Fdetails of former manager Roberto
OL,11,FMancini's pay between 2009-10 and 2012-
OL,12,F13.
OL,14,FThe 61-year-old, now in back in charge
OL,15,Fof Italy for a second stint, was
OL,16,Fquizzed about the charges at a press
OL,17,Fconference ahead of Monday's Nations
OL,18,FLeague match with Turkey in Bursa.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
