OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FHe said: "It's not an issue that
OL,8,Fconcerns me. It's nothing new because
OL,9,Fthis matter has been discussed for the
OL,10,Flast four or five years."
OL,12,FThe Premier League has declined to
OL,13,Fcomment since news of the verdict
OL,14,Femerged last week, and Mancini
OL,15,Fcontinued: "Manchester City has not
OL,16,Fbeen found guilty, and the alleged
OL,17,Fdouble contract is not my concern.
OL,18,FIt's their issue, not mine."
OL,26,@oD@JOUrD@YO]wD@LOUzD@\O]
