OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FCity were charged with failing to
OL,8,Freport accurate financial information
OL,9,Ffor nine seasons from 2009 ` the year
OL,10,FMancini took over.
OL,12,FThey were also charged with failing to
OL,13,Fprovide full details of remuneration
OL,14,Fin contracts with players between 2010-
OL,15,F11 and 2015-16, and with failing to co-
OL,16,Foperate with the Premier League's
OL,17,Finvestigation over a period from 2018
OL,18,Fto 2023.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
