OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FA City spokesperson said on Friday:
OL,8,F"The Premier League process remains
OL,9,Fongoing, with significant elements to
OL,10,Fbe completed, and subject to strict
OL,11,Fconfidentiality.
OL,13,F"As such Manchester City FC's position
OL,14,Fremains consistent with the club's
OL,15,Fstatement of February 2023.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
