CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,F"The club has diligently respected due
OL,8,Fprocess for eight years on the basis
OL,9,Fthat the Premier League board and
OL,10,Fexecutive would behave as an
OL,11,Findependent, impartial and fair-minded
OL,12,Fregulator, free from partisan
OL,13,Finfluence."
OL,15,FUnder Mancini, City won the FA Cup in
OL,16,F2011 and their first top-flight title
OL,17,Fin 44 years in 2012.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@KO]
