OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,FFormer Liverpool midfielder and
OL,8,Fmanager Graeme Souness claimed the
OL,9,Freputation City have built is now
OL,10,Fworthless and their honours record
OL,11,Fshould be expunged.
OL,13,F"The legacy is gone," he told Track
OL,14,FRadio.
OL,16,F"If it goes the wrong way for them
OL,17,Fthey'll be consigned to history that
OL,18,Fthey were cheats and whatever they
OL,19,Fdid, whatever they won in that period,
OL,20,Fshould not count.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@UO]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1790889547
OL,3,CMan City battle with Premier League
OL,4,Cwill take 'a lot more time' ` Ferran
OL,5,CSoriano
OL,7,F"There's an argument for Liverpool to
OL,8,Fhave a couple of Premier Leagues given
OL,9,Fto them.
OL,11,F"For them (City), money's not an issue
OL,12,Fso whatever fine is just like a
OL,13,Fscratch in the surface.
OL,15,F"Relegation? I don't know. This is
OL,16,Fgoing to open a can of worms, which I
OL,17,Fthink may go well beyond the realms of
OL,18,Ffootball."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOUzD@JO]
